# 📡️ `Ifc2x3Snapshot::encode_pack_with` wraps a `SemioEnvelope` header (`wrap_binary`, envelope id
# `stdio.ifc.2x3`, component `Pack`, version 1) around the UTF-8 bytes of
# `write_part21(&snapshot.document)` — the SAME Part-21 text the DSL facet emits. No packed binary
# layout of its own exists at this facet; text-native, same shape as `4`'s own snapshot protocol and
# the sibling STEP artifact's (all three reuse the shared Part-21 tokenizer). The SEMIO envelope is
# described ONCE, framework-side — this file describes ONLY the post-unwrap payload.
dialect protocol
protocol stdio.ifc.2x3.snapshot
version 1
schema stdio.ifc.2x3
start body

framing record
chain payload utf8
